{"id":"vod_lz_54244","vodId":"54244","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"血界战线第一季","name_cn":"血界战线第一季","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20230317-1/41aa7a91fbd5357498c47ff97a5a61c5.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在名为赫尔沙雷姆兹·罗特的虚构城市中，时空扭曲让异世界和人类世界发生了联结，生活在异世界中的古老种族“血界眷属”因此降临，给人类的安全造成了极大的威胁。为了维护世界的和平，一个名为“秘密结社莱布拉”的秘密组织在暗地里活跃地行动着。　　雷欧（阪口大助 配音）本是一个平凡的少年，机缘巧合之下，他误打误撞加入了莱布拉，成为了惩奸除恶的一份子，继而结识了外表粗犷内心温柔的克劳斯（小山力也 配音）、个性开朗油嘴滑舌的扎普（中井和哉 配音）和外表普通实则是狼人的钱皇（小林优 配音）等人。这些志同道合的好友让雷欧的生活拉开了别样的序幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-03-17 09:29:53","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230316/13017_b5efd198/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230316/13015_27f98716/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230316/13024_4b00a198/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230316/13022_7a45c44b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230316/13020_df78c444/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230316/13021_d742e484/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230316/13019_f7bffec6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230316/13023_90fd6069/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230316/13028_c492cb32/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230316/13027_3341f00c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230316/13025_a0e834c8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230316/13026_1a49ed7e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230316/13030_0c79e446/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:33:11.207Z"}